# IronPulse licensing

IronPulse is not licensed under a single set of terms across its whole history. This file is an
index. The complete license texts and the evidence for the boundary are in `LICENSES/`.

## Code at or before the 3.0.0 boundary

All source code, assets, and documentation that existed at or before the IronPulse 3.0.0 licensing
boundary remain under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
Public License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**. They are **not** retroactively relicensed under PolyForm.

- Preserved license text: [`LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt`](LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt)
- Canonical license: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode>

The preserved file is a byte-for-byte copy of the repository's `LICENSE` immediately before this
transition.

## New standalone code authored after the boundary

New source files first created after the IronPulse `v3.0.0` tag are licensed under the **PolyForm
Noncommercial License 1.0.0**. That includes the Liquid Glass and workout-streak modules added for
4.0.0, the user-data export/import modules, and their new tests.

- Preserved official text: [`LICENSES/POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL-1.0.0.txt`](LICENSES/POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL-1.0.0.txt)
- Canonical license: <https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0>

Those new files carry a short header naming PolyForm and pointing at the preserved text. No
`Required Notice:` line is supplied because the project has not established a verified copyright
holder designation for one.

## Files that existed before the boundary and were modified after it

A file that already existed before the boundary is **not** relicensed as a whole. Changes made to
such a file remain part of that historical file and are distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, including
its ShareAlike requirement. New standalone files are the only files identified with the PolyForm
header. `LICENSES/LICENSE-BOUNDARY.md` lists the mixed files touched by this work and explains the
distinction.

## Third-party material

Dependencies, the exercise dataset, and exercise animations keep their own licenses and attribution
requirements. Nothing in this repository grants rights to third-party material that the project does
not own.

## Boundary status

The official 3.0.0 boundary is verified: tag `v3.0.0`, commit
`784fc4d3553dc286db85e576641e4f067993f577`, version name `3.0.0`, version code `7`. The release APK
`IronPulse3.0.0-release.apk` independently reports the same version name and code. The evidence and
the full file scope are recorded in
[`LICENSES/LICENSE-BOUNDARY.md`](LICENSES/LICENSE-BOUNDARY.md).
